3. Representations. The Seller represents and warrants that:
  (a) it has authority to enter into this Agreement and perform its obligations;
  (b) it holds good and marketable title to the Shares, free of liens and encumbrances;
  (c) the most recent financial statements provided to the Buyer are accurate in all material respects;
  (d) there are no undisclosed material liabilities relating to the Seller or the Shares;
  (e) it is in compliance with all applicable laws in all material respects;
  (f) it is not party to any material contract not disclosed to the Buyer, and,
  (g) it has not received written notice of any litigation or governmental proceeding pending or threatened against the Seller or the Shares.
